OL,3,AFilm about enigmatic aristocrat up for
OL,4,Asix Bafta Cymru awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FFeature film Madfabulous - which tells
OL,7,Fthe story of an eccentric 19th Century
OL,8,FWelsh aristocrat - leads the way at
OL,9,Fthis year's Bafta Cymru awards with six
OL,10,Fnominations.
OL,12,FThe nominations have been announced and
OL,13,Falso include five for drama series The
OL,14,FGuest and three for crime thriller
OL,15,FUnder Salt Marsh.
OL,17,FIt's a Sin actor Callum Scott Howells,
OL,18,Fwho stars as Henry Paget in
OL,19,FMadfabulous, previously said it was a
OL,20,F"genuine honour" to portray the fifth
OL,21,FMarquess of Anglesey.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
