OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFilm about enigmatic aristocrat up for
OL,4,Asix Bafta Cymru awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FLee Walters, BAFTA Cymru chairman,
OL,7,Fcongratulated the nominees and said
OL,8,F"each is a testament to the creativity,
OL,9,Fskill and dedication of the people
OL,10,Fworking across Wales' screen
OL,11,Findustries, both in front of and behind
OL,12,Fthe camera".
